name l3build
category Package
revision 69748
shortdesc A testing and building system for (La)TeX
longdesc The build system supports testing and building LaTeX3 code, on
longdesc Linux, Mac OS X and Windows systems. The package offers: A unit
longdesc testing system for (La)TeX code (whether kernel code or
longdesc contributed packages); A system for typesetting package
longdesc documentation; and An automated process for creating CTAN
longdesc releases. The package is essentially independent of other
longdesc material released by the LaTeX3 team, and may be updated on a
longdesc different schedule.
depend l3build.ARCH
depend luatex
runfiles size=48
